  "name": "Community — MiniMax H3 (Turbo LoRA, Fast Motion)",
  "version": "1.3.3",
  "author": "larryvrh",
  "nsfw": false,
  "description": "MiniMax H3 video with the v1-850 Turbo LoRA + matching dual-schedule sampler from larryvrh/MiniMax-H3-Turbo-Lora — a focused 4-step option for heavy or fast motion, where the v4-600 line can produce motion-smear or trailing ghosting. It keeps audio in sync and caps at 6 steps because v1 over-sharpens at higher step counts. Training continues, and audio plus fast-motion behaviour remain open areas, so treat this as a preview. Same base MiniMax H3 checkpoint/text-encoder/VAE as SimpliGen's official MiniMax H3 pack, so no extra large downloads beyond the ~744MB LoRA.",
